# Compatibility note
#
# The canonical OpenCart/local environment template is the repo-root
# .env.example. For new setups, copy ..\..\.env.example to ..\..\.env and keep
# OPENCART_* values there.
#
# Legacy apps\product-factory-api\.secrets\opencart.env is deprecated
# compatibility fallback only. OS/process env vars override both files, and
# repo-root .env overrides legacy OpenCart env values.
